A||||9||1FST2M6||Clutch bleeding... ||||1||
Z||000000||1FST2M6||04-13-2000||03:30 PM||||I've noticed 3 or 4 posts on clutch bleeding and misfortune scrolling back through the week i've been gone. heres my take on them... You guys all work to hard... go to your local parts store get a 1qt. soft plastic container with a nipple on it like the ones you see brake depot and midas use for one man brake bleeding.... fill this 1/2 full with whatever fluid your using in your clutch system. NOT ATF! pull the cap off the master flip over the container into the master with the car on the ground then break the bleed screw on the slave loose a bit, bout 1/2 turn or just enough to notice a drip... go have a Corona... in 15 minutes go back out close the bleed screw and POOF.. full clutch system and no painfull leg. I've Done it to my 86 4spd about 6 times and BlackGTs car once... (I keep cooking slaves with the heat from the exhaust till i changed to AGIP DOT 5.1, from DOT 3 and DOT 4) i hope that helps a few of you.. I hate to see you struggle with somthing that yes may cost you $5.00 but will save you an hours worth the aggrivation and making up new vocabulary. I've been there.. the first 2 times... I've heard nessesity is the mother of all invention.. uum NO i think being disgruntled at 11pm the night before the race is... happy Fiero-ing! ||||reg||1
Z||000001||mshill||04-13-2000||04:14 PM||||1FST2M6, what about the bubble between the plunger and the bleed nipple on the slave end.  Since the hydrolic line into the slave is almost directly across from the bleed nipple, there is virtually no way to get that bubble out without depressing the slave plunger into the slave cylinder.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||04-13-2000||04:20 PM||||All i've done is what I wrote.. I and the owner of the shop I work with got mad at the car and walked away... 15 minutes later.. it was fine...  I've done the same thing for all 4 new slaves and the clutch replace on BlackGts... don't pump anything, don't fight with anything.. nothing.. just flip over the bottle, crack open the slave and go find somthing to do for a few minutes...||||reg||1
